    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d507">

                <pb facs="0620" n="614" sameAs="frus:frus1942v03/pg614"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Moscow Embassy Files: Lot F–96</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The People’s Commissar for Foreign Affairs of the Soviet
                        Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Molotov</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the American Ambassador
                        in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Standley</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-08-02">2 August 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Ambassador</hi>: Kindly transmit the following
                    answer of the President of the Council of People’s Commissars of the USSR J. V.
                    Stalin to the President’s message under date of July 23: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“I have received your last message regarding a survey flight from Alaska.
                            “Our airplane B–25 will arrive in Nome sometime between the 8th and 10th
                            of August and on leaving for the projected survey flight will take on
                            board three American participants in the flight.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Please accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>V. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Molotov</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
